t":{"@id":"px:n122"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the fork validator checks the XSD, not the DTD"},{"@id":"px:s483","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n63"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n207"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Probe artefact: a Playwright probe that calls loadURL on the scene the page already auto-loads can report \"Loading of X3D file aborted\" from the race"},{"@id":"px:s484","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n437"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n97"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The honest out-of-sample number for the rung design is the v1 ladder (built on our 61-prompt audit, applied to scenes nobody here tuned on)"},{"@id":"px:s485","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n250"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n263"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"(see ladder v4 notes in STRATEGY-v2.md section 8)"},{"@id":"px:s486","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n42"},"px:predicate":"maintained_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n341"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The XML side, the object model and the ontology are a coherent, machine-readable stack maintained mostly by one person, Don Brutzman"},{"@id":"px:s487","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n59"},"px:predicate":"maintained_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n113"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"with John Carlson on JSON and Jakub Floty\u0144ski on the ontology"},{"@id":"px:s488","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n433"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n505"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Frame: cm from the Raes corner along the 437 x 111 cloth ([[shroud-cloth-frame]])."},{"@id":"px:s489","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n433"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n458"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"See [[shroud-art-scenes-and-frame]]."},{"@id":"px:s490","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n13"},"px:predicate":"reads","px:object":{"@id":"px:n446"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"SIFT on the start still, ray-cast into the X3D in Blender (drop tree materials)"},{"@id":"px:s491","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n151"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n466"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"From the Library build thread ([[library-hall-build]], 16 Oct 2026, X_ITE 16.5.0): each GaussianSplats node holds the scene's loading state until its first sort, and a frustum-culled node is never sorted, so loadURL hangs"},{"@id":"px:s492","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n151"},"px:predicate":"motivates","px:object":{"@id":"px:n427"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"ProximitySensor streaming keeps culled chunks unloaded, which sidesteps the hang."},{"@id":"px:s493","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n427"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n147"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"ProximitySensor streaming keeps culled chunks unloaded, which sidesteps the hang."},{"@id":"px:s494","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n10"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n333"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Paper by Narra, Lentz, Polys, Brutzman at Web3D 2026"},{"@id":"px:s495","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n10"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n67"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Paper by Narra, Lentz, Polys, Brutzman at Web3D 2026"},{"@id":"px:s496","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n10"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n248"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Paper by Narra, Lentz, Polys, Brutzman at Web3D 2026"},{"@id":"px:s497","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n10"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:obje