al, no HAnim and no X3D 4 nodes"},{"@id":"px:s680","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n363"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n103"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Traceability thread (HagopJay's insight: traceability is a major X3D win in real-time ML pipelines). Library `x3dprov` (hash-chained record in the scene's own `<head><meta>`); repo hagopjay/x3d.ML"},{"@id":"px:s681","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n363"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n305"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Library `x3dprov` (hash-chained record in the scene's own `<head><meta>`); repo hagopjay/x3d.ML (private; PR #3 on branch claude/x3d-traceability-rwrcnn)"},{"@id":"px:s682","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n92"},"px:predicate":"contains","px:object":{"@id":"px:n499"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"research 0.87 GB (blenderization 312 MB, university-scale 370 MB)"},{"@id":"px:s683","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n92"},"px:predicate":"contains","px:object":{"@id":"px:n170"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"research 0.87 GB (blenderization 312 MB, university-scale 370 MB)"},{"@id":"px:s684","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n491"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n158"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"each of these cost a rerun or a lost shell in the 17 Oct 2026 Polys rerun"},{"@id":"px:s685","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n233"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n215"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"launch Playwright with locale 'en-US', else X_ITE throws \"Invalid language tag: en-US@posix\"."},{"@id":"px:s686","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n109"},"px:predicate":"contradicts","px:object":{"@id":"px:n239"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the XSD rejects 163 of the 313 conclusive containment pairs the ontology predicts, so it cannot gate"},{"@id":"px:s687","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n248"},"px:predicate":"works_with","px:object":{"@id":"px:n184"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"coordinated the Web3D 2025 workshop \"Generative AI for 3D content\" with Athanasios Malamos and Don Brutzman"},{"@id":"px:s688","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n297"},"px:predicate":"validates","px:object":{"@id":"px:n446"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"XSD and Schematron check the file, DEF/USE and ROUTE rules check semantics"},{"@id":"px:s689","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n308"},"px:predicate":"writes","px:object":{"@id":"px:n98"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Meshy, Tripo, Hunyuan3D, TRELLIS.2 and Rodin emit PBR-textured, retopologized, part-segmented, auto-rigged meshes as GLB and FBX"},{"@id":"px:s690","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n418"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n379"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"then `x3dio.import_x3d.load(bpy.context, path)`"},{"@id":"px:s691","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n418"},"px:predicate":"implements","px:object":{"@id":"px:n382"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the modern X3D 4.0 path (parse_x3d40 + populate) handles meshes, PBR, Viewpoints"},{"@id":"px:s692","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n432"},"px:predicate":"renders","px:object":{"@id":"px:n446"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"staged lit renders (Cycles, 48 spp, OIDN denoise, 960x540 in ~10-40 s per scene with 2 threads) can be produced in the cloud"},{"@id":"px:s693","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n110"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n382"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"one X3D 4.0 file carries set, 35 materials, 60 lights and the camera"},{"@id":"px:s694","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n110"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n230"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the camera (TimeSensor Film + interpolators, no Script)"},{"@id":"px:s695","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n60"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n471"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"xite rows copied server-side from v3 S98mPP7PcEtR5kKWgSU2y7"},{"@id":"px:s696","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n289"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n141"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Few-shot beats zero-shot for every model (p < 0.05 each, pooled p = 4e-21)"},{"@id":"px:s697","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n481"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n141"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"chain of thought does not help (pooled p = 0.24) and for gpt-4o it is worse (p = 0.024)"},{"@id":"px:s698","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n355"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n275"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"`parts_contact.py` walks the scene graph, composes the Transform matrices, takes the bounds of Box, Sphere, Cone, Cylinder and point-list geometry"},{"@id":"px:s699","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n275"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n159"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"`parts_contact.py` walks the scene graph, composes the Transform matrices"},{"@id":"px:s700","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n89"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n513"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the prompts the DSPy thread wrote were run verbatim on Dr. Polys's ten prompts"},{"@id":"px:s701","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n89"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n480"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"run verbatim on Dr. Polys's ten prompts, which its optimiser never saw (gemini-3.8-flash, 100 trials per arm, grade L)"},{"@id":